/* ---------- versions anglaises : FAQ, about, simulator ---------- */
const FAQ_EN = [
 ['How do I get a quote?', '<p>Quotes are free and valid for 30 days. Message us on WhatsApp, use the “Request a quote” button on a product page, or ask for a call back from the <a href="/#/contact">Contact page</a>, telling us the model and the delivery location.</p>'],
 ['What are the delivery times?', '<p>Allow 7 to 10 days for a dedicated delivery and 2 to 3 weeks for a grouped delivery at a lower price. The lead time starts when the deposit is received.</p>'],
 ['Do you deliver across Europe?', '<p>Yes, we deliver anywhere in Europe, and outside the European Union on quote. Outside the EU, customs duties, import VAT and formalities are at your expense unless the quote says otherwise.</p>'],
 ['Who unloads and installs the mobile home?', '<p>AURIAM HOME unloads and installs it free of charge. Preparing the ground is your responsibility, and if access is difficult and a crane is needed, you hire a local crane at your own cost. A ground preparation plan is sent to you before delivery.</p>'],
 ['How does payment work?', '<p><strong>Cash payment:</strong> before the truck leaves, 100% of the transport costs and 20% of the product price; on your site, after checking the condition of the product, the remaining 80% and VAT.</p><p><strong>Instalment payment:</strong> 100% of transport costs (plus VAT) before delivery, 30% of the product price on delivery, then the remaining 70% and VAT in several instalments of up to 36 months, as set out in the signed contract. No interest is charged: you pay the normal price, spread over time. The product remains the property of AURIAM HOME until paid in full. See the <a href="/en/simulator/">simulator</a>.</p>'],
 ['Do I need a bank for instalment payment?', '<p>No. AURIAM HOME can finance your purchase directly, without a bank or lender, subject to acceptance of your application and the terms of the contract.</p>'],
 ['Do the prices include delivery and VAT?', '<p>No. Prices are indicative and exclude delivery and VAT. The transport cost depends on the destination and is shown in your quote.</p>'],
 ['Can I visit the showground?', '<p>Yes, visits are welcome by appointment at Route de Lyon, Périgueux. We are open Monday to Friday 9 am to 6 pm and Saturday 9 am to 1 pm. Contact us to arrange a time.</p>'],
 ['Do I need a permit to install a mobile home?', '<p>It depends on your municipality and your land. Obtaining permits is the buyer’s responsibility: check with your local town hall before ordering.</p>'],
 ['What should I check on delivery?', '<p>You inspect the product in the presence of the carrier and sign a delivery report. The balance is due after this inspection.</p>'],
 ['How can I contact you?', '<p>By WhatsApp, by e-mail, or by asking for a call back from the <a href="/#/contact">Contact page</a>. We reply during opening hours.</p>']
];
